gen_ai.tool.call.result

Field: gen_ai.tool.call.result
Field Set: gen_ai
Type: flattened | Level: extended
Description: The result returned by the tool call (if any and if execution was successful).
Example: {
  "temperature_range": {
    "high": 75,
    "low": 60
  },
  "conditions": "sunny"
}

gen_ai.tool.definitions

Field: gen_ai.tool.definitions
Field Set: gen_ai
Type: flattened | Level: extended
Description: The list of source system tool definitions available to the GenAI agent or model.
Example: {
  "type": "function",
  "name": "get_current_weather",
  "description": "Get the current weather in a given location",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "location": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "The city and state, e.g. San Francisco, CA"
      },
      "unit": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "celsius",
          "fahrenheit"
        ]
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "location",
      "unit"
    ]
  }
}

